invariant: INV-54
file: proof/coverage.py
catches: test/lint-matrix.sh
reason: a floored harness whose cover run gives no number stops failing
  the check, so a floor that nobody measured stays green. lint-matrix
  gives reach_table a floored run for each cause and requires a failed
  floor with the cell of that cause.

--- old
            if name in floors:
                fell.append((name, cell, floors[name]))
            continue
        print(f"proof-reach: {name} {m.group(3)}%", flush=True)
--- new
            continue
        print(f"proof-reach: {name} {m.group(3)}%", flush=True)
